-- Possible Impacket SecretDump Remote Activity - Zeek | T1003.002, T1003.003, T1003.004 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/network/zeek/zeek_smb_converted_win_impacket_secretdump.yml | NOTA: fallback QRadarAQL_payload_pipeline: campos sem propriedade DSM mapeada são buscados em UTF8(payload) – custo maior, crie custom properties
SELECT * FROM events WHERE (LOWER("File Path") LIKE '%\%' AND LOWER("File Path") LIKE '%admin$%') AND LOWER(UTF8(payload)) LIKE '%system32*%' AND LOWER(UTF8(payload)) LIKE '%.tmp%'
